{"at":"2026-10-11T18:39:31.551959+00:00","brief_hash":"821c7c33ef286f20d46bda26914662833dff39081ac78871dd6bd464801c6655","event":"contract_written","openapi_hash":null,"operations":["cards_balance","cards_list","contact_email_get","statement_pdf_send","statement_week_change","statement_week_decide","statement_week_get"],"path":"/Users/burakalicankilinc/Desktop/build-the-builder-main/agent/artifacts/20261011T193801_4ba43214/derived.openapi.1.json","run_id":"20261011T193801_4ba43214","unclear":["All seven services: the documents specify calendar dates as dd.MM.yyyy, not the ISO representation normally associated with OpenAPI format date. The schemas mark calendar dates with format date as requested; the documented wire representation remains dd.MM.yyyy.","All seven services: client timeout and retry policy are not agreed. The contract suggests no automatic retry on statement.week.change and statement.pdf.send because both have side effects. Rate limits per client have not been supplied.","All seven services: request examples include data and call, but the mandatory status of the envelope fields and call.ani/call.lang is not stated. call.lang is shown as tr without an explicit allowed-value list. The documents do not provide a complete mandatory-field table, including whether cards.list.aiFlow is mandatory.","cards.list: the 1 October contract leaves production card-number masking unconfirmed. The 9 October recap says production returns the full card number; test data remains masked with first six and last four visible. The test data does not contain the middle digits needed for last-six or full-number disambiguation.","cards.list: validCardsCount has examples but no explicit field definition. isMainCard false cards are included in the service list even though the analysis excludes them from eligible card selection.","cards.balance: transferAmount is described in the contract as carried over from the previous period, while the 8 October analysis also uses it for foreign currency moved into Turkish Lira. The cases and customer-facing wording for that transfer remain open.","cards.balance: the foreign-currency future-period total in the no-statement-debt reading remains open. The exact schema representation of a new card with no issued statement or dates is not specified.","statement.week.get: there is no documented field or callable service indicating whether the once-per-calendar-year change right has been used, although the analysis requires that check before offering a change.","statement.week.decide and statement.week.change: the documents do not give a complete catalogue of responseCode, responseMessage or change exitState values, or the error returned when the requested week is already the current week. Only successful values are illustrated. The newer yearly-limit business rule is not accompanied by a service-level refusal code.","contact.email.get: communicationType is illustrated as Both and Phone, but no exhaustive allowed-value list is given. The meanings of ibanCountryCode, ibanAreaCode, ibanPhoneNum, commGramType and exitState are not explicitly defined.","statement.week.decide and statement.week.change: responseMessage appears in examples but its meaning is not explicitly defined.","statement.pdf.send: currencyType has four allowed currencies, but the documents do not specify which to select for a request to send a statement spanning multiple currencies, or whether separate sends are needed."]}
